Ta sai neli morfiini.

367
00:18:31,276 --> 00:18:32,361
Kuidas valu on?

368
00:18:32,986 --> 00:18:33,820
Langes 8-ni.

369
00:18:33,821 --> 00:18:36,365
See on lateraalne STEMI. Teata sellest.

370
00:18:36,865 --> 00:18:38,116
Elektroodid olid madalal?

371
